// Floor plans, baked. Generated by floor/bake.py — do not edit by hand.
//
// A plan is one station's whole floor: the quarters, the hallway lit before anything opens, and a
// hundred office slots, each carrying the run of hallway that first reaches it. Slots are in the order
// they open, which is by how far they are on foot from the plaza — a slot tucked behind the deck is a
// few tiles away and a long walk round, and opening it early would put an office where nobody can see it.
//
// The fixed floor is not in here: the yard, the airlock and the bay are the station's own. A plan was
// drawn around them, which is why a plan belongs to the theme whose yard it was drawn around.

